# Copy to ~/.config/macos-like/keep-dark.conf (or $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/macos-like/).
#
# The light theme turns MacTahoe's dark graphite tiles white. Icons listed here
# keep their dark tile. One icon name (the app's Icon= value) per line; an
# alias works too, e.g. "com.visualstudio.code" for visual-studio-code. Text
# after # is ignored.
#
# Example: keep the terminals dark.
#kitty
#org.gnome.Terminal
